  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting Elections for Ethiopia&apos;s Democracy Strengthening - SEEDS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support the delivery of a fair and transparent electoral process in Ethiopia as well as supporting the National Electoral Board&#x2019;s capacity to deliver future elections. This will assist with Ethiopia&#x2019;s political transition which also responds to a priority opportunity identified in DFID Ethiopia&#x2019;s country development diagnostic.</narrative>
  </description>
